  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Despite the fact that display names and user names are 2 different systems, for some reason vrchat still makes it so that if a user name is taken, no user can use the name as display name, even if nobody is using the name as a display name. The only way for someone to use the name as a display name is for the creator of the account with the username to delete their account. This is unfortunate since the name isn't even being used as a display name, and it locks users out of expressing themselves. Since they are 2 different systems, vrchat should allow users to use a name as a display name as long as it isn't already being used as a display name. Arbitrarily locking off displays names off of both user names and display names is unnecessary.",
